    <string name="superchat_report_email_disclosure">Email opens an external mail app with a draft to %1$s. It includes the reason, optional details, model name, and up to 300 characters of the AI reply. It is not sent until you tap Send. The app has no in-app reporting server yet. You can also save a local note.</string>
    <string name="superchat_report_email_button">Open email draft</string>
    <string name="superchat_report_inapp_disclosure">When you submit, PK-AI sends the selected reason, optional details, model and app version, and up to 300 characters of this AI reply over HTTPS to the report service, which emails %1$s. A random app-install ID is used only to limit abuse. No other chat history is sent. Avoid adding sensitive personal information. If submission fails, nothing is confirmed as sent; you can use the external email draft or save locally.</string>
